    "turn_text": "I mean, I'm not hostile to pro-life members. I totally get it. I mean, I understand where people are coming from. I just would say that you know these are complicated decisions and many instances the pro-life folks are very good people I don't judge them at all the reality is do you want the government in the middle of this situation and what's interesting about a lot of my friends who are pro-life too they don't want the government anything else right they don't want",
